WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:13.675
Zann gulped.

2
00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:15.315
"What should I do now?"

3
00:00:15.835 --> 00:00:16.236
he thought.

4
00:00:16.836 --> 00:00:20.357
The miner stared at him, his expression eager and cruel.

5
00:00:20.377 --> 00:00:24.158
"You promised to teach me how to get my revenge.

6
00:00:24.978 --> 00:00:26.258
Let's get started."

7
00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:28.539
Zann didn't know what to say.

8
00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:32.720
Sure, he could teach the man how to do a basic Immobilization spell.

9
00:00:33.392 --> 00:00:37.855
Most kids in Magica learned that one in case they were ever attacked by a dragon or other

10
00:00:37.895 --> 00:00:38.736
dangerous creature.

11
00:00:39.396 --> 00:00:44.500
But Zann couldn't imagine using it on any human or animal that wasn't threatening his life.

12
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.121
It wouldn't be right.

13
00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:49.663
There were other spells the man would probably like too.

14
00:00:50.323 --> 00:00:54.486
Nasty, dark spells that nobody in Magica ever used for anything.

15
00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:59.229
Back in the Old Times, such spells were common, or so Zann had heard.

16
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.991
But he would never use that type of magic either.

17
00:01:02.011 --> 00:01:04.589
"I'm sorry," he said, shaking his head.

18
00:01:04.609 --> 00:01:06.990
"I don't believe in using magic to hurt people.

19
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:08.791
I won't teach you to do it."

20
00:01:09.572 --> 00:01:10.712
The man rolled his eyes.

21
00:01:10.732 --> 00:01:13.013
"Grow up, kid.

22
00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.455
The world is a nasty place.

23
00:01:16.135 --> 00:01:17.916
I'm just trying to protect myself.

24
00:01:18.577 --> 00:01:21.318
You'll do the same if you know what's good for you."

25
00:01:22.579 --> 00:01:23.419
Was that a threat?

26
00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.401
Zann wasn't sure, but he didn't like the look in the man's eyes.

27
00:01:27.421 --> 00:01:28.882
"I've made up my mind.

28
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:29.943
I'm sorry.

29
00:01:30.363 --> 00:01:31.664
I'd better get back to camp now."

30
00:01:32.352 --> 00:01:33.973
He tried to step past the miner.

31
00:01:34.554 --> 00:01:36.896
The man stopped him with a hand on his chest.

32
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:39.598
"You're not going anywhere," he said.

33
00:01:39.618 --> 00:01:42.541
"Not until you give me what I want."

34
00:01:43.581 --> 00:01:44.502
Zann stepped back.

35
00:01:44.522 --> 00:01:47.525
"No," he said as firmly as he could.

36
00:01:47.545 --> 00:01:49.046
"I won't do it."

37
00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:51.248
The miner scowled.

38
00:01:51.268 --> 00:01:57.253
"Fine. Then I'm going back right now to wake up your bosses and tell them exactly what you've

39
00:01:57.273 --> 00:01:57.933
been doing."

40
00:01:57.953 --> 00:02:00.836
"No!" Zann cried in alarm.

41
00:02:01.304 --> 00:02:02.285
"Please don't do that."

42
00:02:02.986 --> 00:02:03.926
The man smirked.

43
00:02:03.946 --> 00:02:07.890
"Oh, are you afraid they'll punish you?

44
00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.113
Maybe you'd prefer I punish you myself, huh?"

45
00:02:12.854 --> 00:02:17.518
Before Zann could figure out what he meant, the man ran at him with his fists raised.

46
00:02:17.538 --> 00:02:23.483
"Hey!" Zann yelped, leaping out of the way just in time to avoid being punched.

47
00:02:24.183 --> 00:02:27.966
"Hold still, kid," the miner growled, trying to grab him.

48
00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:29.728
Zann darted away.

49
00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.481
He was shaking with fear.

50
00:02:32.302 --> 00:02:35.104
Nobody had ever attacked him physically before!

51
00:02:35.124 --> 00:02:40.129
"Well, except for Zing," he thought, with a stab of worry for his dragon friend.

52
00:02:40.149 --> 00:02:43.051
"But that's just playing, at least most of the time."

53
00:02:44.072 --> 00:02:45.953
The man was already coming at him again.

54
00:02:46.614 --> 00:02:49.997
Zann jumped out of the way, which also reminded him of Zing.

55
00:02:50.557 --> 00:02:55.682
Sometimes the easiest way to avoid the little dragon's attacks was just to jump out of the way.

56
00:02:55.702 --> 00:03:00.678
"Zing hates when I do that though," he thought as he barely dodged another blow.

57
00:03:00.698 --> 00:03:05.002
"If I don't get out of here soon, this guy is likely to get even angrier if he

58
00:03:05.042 --> 00:03:05.802
can't catch me.

59
00:03:06.483 --> 00:03:11.987
And if he does manage to grab me Not wanting to think about that, Zann rubbed his hands

60
00:03:12.048 --> 00:03:14.750
together to create enough friction to zap away.

61
00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:20.755
As magic energy sparked from his hands, he was forced to leap aside to avoid another punch.

62
00:03:21.275 --> 00:03:26.460
That brought him close to the wormhole, which swirled open in response to the friction he was creating.

63
00:03:27.148 --> 00:03:30.050
The miner stopped short, his eyes going wide.

64
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:31.490
"What's that?"

65
00:03:32.491 --> 00:03:36.293
Zann stopped to catch his breath, being careful to stay out of reach.

66
00:03:36.313 --> 00:03:38.454
"It's a wormhole," he said.

67
00:03:38.474 --> 00:03:42.377
"It leads into the vortex, which connects all the known worlds."

68
00:03:43.097 --> 00:03:45.358
He glanced around at the Terrican landscape.

69
00:03:45.378 --> 00:03:47.539
"And some unknown ones too."

70
00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:52.082
The man stared into the swirling wormhole, seeming mesmerized.

71
00:03:52.102 --> 00:03:54.163
"Other worlds?

72
00:03:54.923 --> 00:03:55.624
What do you mean?"

73
00:03:56.432 --> 00:03:57.173
Zann shrugged.

74
00:03:57.193 --> 00:04:01.515
"If you promise to stop attacking me, I promise to tell you all about it."

75
00:04:02.635 --> 00:04:04.557
The man turned and sneered at him.

76
00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:07.658
"Oh, another promise from you?

77
00:04:08.299 --> 00:04:09.839
Is this one a lie too?

78
00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:12.781
Because it sounds like a tall tale to me.

79
00:04:13.381 --> 00:04:14.502
Magic is one thing.

80
00:04:14.722 --> 00:04:18.004
But there's definitely no such thing as a portal to another world!"

81
00:04:18.744 --> 00:04:21.626
He charged toward Zann, fists raised.

82
00:04:22.306 --> 00:04:25.508
Zann didn't have time to completely dodge the attack this time.

83
00:04:26.036 --> 00:04:29.919
Instead he ducked, letting the man's fists pass over his head.

84
00:04:30.479 --> 00:04:35.202
Then he slammed his shoulder into his attacker's torso, hoping to push him away.

85
00:04:36.142 --> 00:04:39.825
He did push him away—straight into the wormhole!

86
00:04:40.645 --> 00:04:45.228
"Ahh!" The miner disappeared into the vortex.

87
00:04:45.989 --> 00:04:46.409
"Oh no!"

88
00:04:47.109 --> 00:04:48.150
Zann rushed forward.

89
00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:51.012
But the wormhole was already swirling shut.

90
00:04:51.668 --> 00:04:57.090
It opened again when Zann came closer, and he stared into its glowing depths, feeling guilty.

91
00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.570
What had he done?

92
00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.471
"That man was a jerk," he thought.

93
00:05:01.491 --> 00:05:04.792
"But he won't have any idea what to do in the vortex.

94
00:05:05.352 --> 00:05:06.612
He might not even survive!"

95
00:05:07.632 --> 00:05:12.034
Before he could figure out what to do, there was a buzz of magic energy behind him.

96
00:05:12.534 --> 00:05:13.074
He turned.

97
00:05:13.574 --> 00:05:14.674
Perda was standing there.

98
00:05:14.694 --> 00:05:17.015
"Zann!" she exclaimed.

99
00:05:17.035 --> 00:05:22.817
"Perda!" He rushed toward her, and then stopped and stared into her eyes.

100
00:05:23.398 --> 00:05:24.298
Was it really her?

101
00:05:24.318 --> 00:05:26.359
"How where?"

102
00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:27.780
Perda laughed.

103
00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:32.883
"I found you by using a Uniting spell.

104
00:05:33.603 --> 00:05:36.985
It wasn't easy to create enough friction to get here with these things on."

105
00:05:37.906 --> 00:05:39.426
She held up her shackled wrists.

106
00:05:40.307 --> 00:05:43.188
Zann looked down and saw that her legs were shackled too.

107
00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:44.689
"But I did it!"

108
00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.110
she said proudly.

109
00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.372
"A Uniting spell," Zann echoed.

110
00:05:49.964 --> 00:05:52.106
"That only works if the person wants to be found."

111
00:05:52.606 --> 00:05:53.407
He smiled at her.

112
00:05:53.427 --> 00:05:55.829
"And of course I wanted you to find me."

113
00:05:55.849 --> 00:05:57.050
"I know.

114
00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.712
I wanted to find you too.

115
00:05:58.732 --> 00:05:59.893
A lot.

116
00:06:00.353 --> 00:06:01.354
That made it easier."

117
00:06:02.074 --> 00:06:05.477
As she smiled back, Zann thought she'd never looked prettier.

118
00:06:06.218 --> 00:06:08.520
Suddenly he wasn't sure what to do next.

119
00:06:09.301 --> 00:06:12.063
He wanted to hug her, but he wasn't sure she'd like that.

120
00:06:12.744 --> 00:06:17.087
So instead he just stood there, gazing into her beautiful brown eyes.
